.venv/
.venv-py*/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.pla_runs/
.coverage
# Per-worker parallel coverage data (`.coverage.<host>.<pid>.<rand>`), written
# into the repo root by every `-n auto` run before coverage combines them.
# Kept as its own rule rather than widening the line above to `.coverage*`:
# the literal dot keeps it narrow (`.coveragerc` stays visible).
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
